---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<Layout>
  <h2><code>.mcenahle.dev</code> 网站生态</h2>

  <table class="table table-bordered">
    <thead>
      <tr style="background: #2b5bae; color: white;">
        <th>网站名</th>
        <th>GitHub 仓库</th>
        <th>详情</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>mcenahle.dev</td>
        <td
          ><a href="https://mcenahle.dev/gh/dev/" target="_blank"
            ><Icon name="mdi:github" /> <u>访问</u></a
          ></td
        >
        <td>
          <a
            href="#"
            data-toggle="modal"
            data-target="#main-dev-Modal"
            style="cursor: pointer;"><u>详情</u></a
          >
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>game.mcenahle.dev</td>
        <td
          ><a href="https://mcenahle.dev/gh/game-dev-site/" target="_blank"
            ><Icon name="mdi:github" /> <u>访问</u></a
          ></td
        >
        <td>
          <a
            href="#"
            data-toggle="modal"
            data-target="#game-dev-Modal"
            style="cursor: pointer;"><u>详情</u></a
          >
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>blog.mcenahle.dev</td>
        <td
          ><a
            href="https://mcenahle.dev/gh/mcenahle-blog-template/"
            target="_blank"><Icon name="mdi:github" /> <u>访问</u></a
          ></td
        >
        <td>
          <a
            href="#"
            data-toggle="modal"
            data-target="#blog-dev-Modal"
            style="cursor: pointer;"><u>详情</u></a
          >
        </td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p>
    2026年8月29日，开通 <code>https://mcenahle.dev/gh/repo/path/</code> 的短链接。访问
    <code>https://mcenahle.dev/gh/repo/path/</code> 可被重定向到 <code
      >https://github.com/mcenahle/repo/path/</code
    >。
  </p>
</Layout>

<div
  class="modal fade"
  id="main-dev-Modal"
  tabindex="-1"
  role="dialog"
  aria-labelledby="main-dev-ModalLabel"
  aria-hidden="true"
>
  <div class="modal-dialog">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <button
          type="button"
          class="close"
          data-dismiss="modal"
          aria-hidden="true">&times;</button
        >
        <h4 class="modal-title" id="main-dev-ModalLabel">mcenahle.dev 开发</h4>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body dev-ecosystem">
        <p>
          该网站的开发自从购买 <code>mcenahle.dev</code> 就已经开始，在购买之后及之后几日，基本使用
          Astro 完成了开发，后被逐渐废弃，随后于2026年8月29日中午及下午完成了降级改版。改版后访问速度大幅提升，重回经典风格。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-footer">
        <a
          href="https://mcenahle.dev"
          target="_blank"
          class="btn btn-primary"
          role="button">返回主页</a
        >
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-default" data-dismiss="modal"
          >关闭</button
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div
  class="modal fade"
  id="game-dev-Modal"
  tabindex="-1"
  role="dialog"
  aria-labelledby="game-dev-ModalLabel"
  aria-hidden="true"
>
  <div class="modal-dialog">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <button
          type="button"
          class="close"
          data-dismiss="modal"
          aria-hidden="true">&times;</button
        >
        <h4 class="modal-title" id="game-dev-ModalLabel">
          game.mcenahle.dev 开发
        </h4>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body dev-ecosystem">
        <p>
          在接触 DDLC
          游戏，并被“第四面墙”、“Sayo-nara”吓到后，准备自己开发一个自己的 Ren'py
          游戏。目前该游戏项目被教资暂时搁置。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-footer">
        <a
          href="https://game.mcenahle.dev"
          target="_blank"
          class="btn btn-primary"
          role="button">访问 <Icon name="mdi:open-in-new" /></a
        >
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-default" data-dismiss="modal"
          >关闭</button
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div
  class="modal fade"
  id="blog-dev-Modal"
  tabindex="-1"
  role="dialog"
  aria-labelledby="blog-dev-ModalLabel"
  aria-hidden="true"
>
  <div class="modal-dialog">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <button
          type="button"
          class="close"
          data-dismiss="modal"
          aria-hidden="true">&times;</button
        >
        <h4 class="modal-title" id="blog-dev-ModalLabel">
          blog.mcenahle.dev 开发
        </h4>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body dev-ecosystem">
        <p>
          为了让个人博客网站具备个人性质，使用 Astro + Bootstrap 3
          搭建了一个个人博客 demo 网站。该网站目前已经陆续继承了众多使用功能。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-footer">
        <a
          href="https://blog.mcenahle.dev"
          target="_blank"
          class="btn btn-primary"
          role="button">访问 <Icon name="mdi:open-in-new" /></a
        >
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-default" data-dismiss="modal"
          >关闭</button
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
